    "detailed_description": "<h1>Recommended For You</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102130/extras/31a7026a2db76dd09788653f91fa5045.poster.avif?t=1683001193\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102130/extras/31a7026a2db76dd09788653f91fa5045.webm?t=1683001193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102130/extras/31a7026a2db76dd09788653f91fa5045.mp4?t=1683001193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This Game</h2>Immerse yourself in the quest of Seraphina, the princess of Artolia, who embarks on a perilous journey to retrieve the monstrous heart of the king, a coveted object sought after by her father. But as she delves deeper into her mission, she will unearth twisted occurrences that defy explanation, a darkness lurking in the shadows that threatens to consume her.<br><br>And yet, she must press on, gathering scarce treasures along the way and engaging in turn-based combat that appears deceptively simple but conceals an intricate web of strategies that demand cunning and quick thinking.<br><br>Are you ready to face the horrors that await?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2>- Engaging, dramatic plot- Rich battle system<br>- Hundreds of skills &amp; equipments for you to freely customize your characters",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102130/extras/31a7026a2db76dd09788653f91fa5045.poster.avif?t=1683001193\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102130/extras/31a7026a2db76dd09788653f91fa5045.webm?t=1683001193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102130/extras/31a7026a2db76dd09788653f91fa5045.mp4?t=1683001193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This Game</h2>Immerse yourself in the quest of Seraphina, the princess of Artolia, who embarks on a perilous journey to retrieve the monstrous heart of the king, a coveted object sought after by her father. But as she delves deeper into her mission, she will unearth twisted occurrences that defy explanation, a darkness lurking in the shadows that threatens to consume her.<br><br>And yet, she must press on, gathering scarce treasures along the way and engaging in turn-based combat that appears deceptively simple but conceals an intricate web of strategies that demand cunning and quick thinking.<br><br>Are you ready to face the horrors that await?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2>- Engaging, dramatic plot- Rich battle system<br>- Hundreds of skills &amp; equipments for you to freely customize your characters",
